{"id": "36707", "title": "偷菜也疯狂", "author": "九本精华", "category": "科幻小说", "count": 58, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/36/36707/36707s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/36/36707.htm", "intro": "你知道吗？在地球的表层下面，有一块鲜为人知的地心大陆，在那里发展起来的地心文明，比我们地表人类的文明进程迟了五百年。现在，地心大陆上的三个帝国为了争夺稀有资源，经年发动战争，致使生灵涂炭、民不聊生。凭谛和融雪穿越到地心大陆，以暴制暴、力挽狂澜。哈哈！我巍巍中华熬了上下五千年，终于成为别人的救世主了！这怎不让每一个华夏儿女欢欣雀跃，争相一睹为快呢！", "base": "files/article/html/36/36707", "chapters": [{"title": "前言", "volume": true}, {"title": "再苦也要笑一笑", "file": "2834980.html", "available": false}, {"title": "惊吓岛", "volume": true}, {"title": "第1章  青山空向人", "file": "2834982.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章  风云再起", "file": "2834983.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章  祸从天降", "file": "2834984.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章  救世主", "file": "2834985.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章  洞里乾坤大", "file": "2834986.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章  奇迹", "file": "2834987.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章  惊吓岛", "file": "2834988.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章  偷菜（1）", "file": "2834989.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章  偷菜（2）", "file": "2834990.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章  调虎离山", "file": "2834991.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章  偷菜（3）", "file": "2834992.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章  家园", "file": "2834993.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章  偷菜（4）", "file": "2834994.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章  三头", "file": "2834995.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章  复仇", "file": "2834996.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章  兵临城下", "file": "2834997.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章  生死之间", "file": "2834998.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章  英雄传奇", "file": "2834999.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章  风云突变", "file": "2835000.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22章  江湖最后一个大佬", "file": "2835001.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章  老天！把他还给我", "file": "2835